  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-01.htm",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: You again! I was just thinking until you started talking to me. What is it?",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; ((player.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL) && player.hasQuestCompleted(Q10288_SecretMission.class.getSimpleNa"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Uh... I can come back later.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence 32757-02.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "32757-02.htm",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-02.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-03.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: You! Can't you see I'm thinking? Thinking of these idiot monks... thinking of the unspeakable horrors that will befall them before I'm done here. (Only characters level 82 and above who have completed Secret Mission may take this quest.)",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; NOT ((player.getLevel() >= MIN_LEVEL) && player.hasQuestCompleted(Q10288_SecretMission.class.getSimpleNa"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-05.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-05.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Alright, so how goes the hunt?",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "I defeated enough monks.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence 32757-08.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "32757-08.html",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html",
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-06.html",
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-07.html"
     ],
     "effect": "cond:1"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-01.html": {
   "file": "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-01.html",
   "quest": 10288,
   "text": "Greymore: Blast! You startled me, fool. Who are you?",
   "header": "Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Ah, I've found you!\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10288_SecretMission 32757-02.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10288_SecretMission",
     "event": "32757-02.html",
     "quest": 10288,
     "to": "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-02.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-00.htm": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-00.htm",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: By the gods! Stop sneaking up on me! Anyway, I'm busy just now and while you seem pleasant enough, that doesn't free up my busy afternoon. (Only characters level 82 and up who have completed Secret Mission can take this quest.)",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; ((player.getLevel() < 82) || (q10288 == null) || !q10288.isCompleted())"
   ],
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-01.htm": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-01.htm",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: WAH! You again, why do you keep scaring me? You must truly possess the acumen of the rodent, treading so silently. Anyway, I am not to be bothered, I am reading that letter you delivered from Brother Dominic.",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state CREATED; !((player.getLevel() < 82) || (q10288 == null) || !q10288.isCompleted())"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Ask if you should leave.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10289_FadeToBlack 32757-02.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10289_FadeToBlack",
     "event": "32757-02.htm",
     "quest": 10289,
     "to": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-02.htm"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-04.html": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-04.html",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: As I told you already, you are to capture the Master of Splendor Annays and bring me his Mark of Splendor .",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-05.html": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-05.html",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Seriously! So you're good at scaring people. Then what? Want a prize?",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2|3"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Say you captured the Master of Splendor Annays.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10289_FadeToBlack 32757-06.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10289_FadeToBlack",
     "event": "32757-06.html",
     "quest": 10289,
     "to": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-06.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-06.html",
      "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-07.html",
      "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-08.html"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-10.html": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-10.html",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: What? Are you here to relive your glory? Are you going to buy us all a round of drinks? I already thanked you, now you're just showing off. (This quest is already complete.)",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "when": [
    "always"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-02.htm",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Yes, fool, leave me to my craft... wait. Wait! Don't go yet, something just occurred to me. Brother Dominic assigned me a mission and I think you might be able to help me with this one. You see, I have a dream. In this dream, I am not stuck in this dreary Monastery surrounded by th…",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Accept the mission.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence 32757-04.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "32757-04.html",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-04.html",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-04.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-04.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Finally, we'll be able to cleanse this place of these filthy monks. I can see it in your eyes, you want it as much as I do. And I can tell you, I REALLY do. These fools will know fear before the day is over. You must defeat them for me. All monks in the monastery, I am not picky ab…",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-06.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-06.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Then you need proof! You have shown the uncanny ability to startle me but I can read a lie in any man's eyes, especially now that I've been surrounded by these phony monks.",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-07.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-07.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: This is good, but I will only reward you once I have at least 100 of these monks' rags in front of me.",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Ah... now doesn't that feel good? With every monk erased from this world, it feels a little better. Sometimes I don't even see the monk fall, I just get that feeling that the world is a better place and I know why. Anyway, how did we fare?",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "1"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "I brought 100 Rags of Monks",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence rags100",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "rags100",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-09.html",
