  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-09.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Nicely done, creature. Take care in your travels. What will you do now?",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"I have more rags.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence 32757-08.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "32757-08.html",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html",
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-06.html",
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-07.html"
     ],
     "effect": "cond:1"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I've got a fever... and the only cure is more monk blood.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence 32757-04.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "32757-04.html",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-04.html",
     "effect": "start"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"I tire of this. I am done with this mission.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence exit1",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "exit1",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-12.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-12.html",
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-13.html"
     ],
     "effect": "end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-10.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-10.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Hm... looks like you don't have that many rags. Pity, I wish you did. Very sincerely.",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-12.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-12.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Ahh... but you still have some of these monk's rags. If you quit now, we'll have to throw them away.",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Hmm... Ok I have more rags.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence 32757-08.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "32757-08.html",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html",
     "toAll": [
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-08.html",
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-06.html",
      "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-07.html"
     ],
     "effect": "cond:1"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Yeah... actually beating up more monks sounds good.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence 32757-04.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "32757-04.html",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-04.html",
     "effect": "start"
    },
    {
     "text": "\"Oh well. I'm done with this.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence exit2",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence",
     "event": "exit2",
     "quest": 270,
     "to": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-13.html",
     "effect": "end"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-13.html": {
   "file": "Q00270_TheOneWhoEndsSilence/32757-13.html",
   "quest": 270,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Ah well, felt good while it lasted. Good bye then.",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-02.html": {
   "file": "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-02.html",
   "quest": 10288,
   "text": "Greymore: What?! You followed me here? Fool!",
   "header": "Greymore",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Relax, I'm here with a parcel from Brother Dominic.\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10288_SecretMission 32757-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10288_SecretMission",
     "event": "32757-03.html",
     "quest": 10288,
     "to": "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-03.html",
     "effect": "reward"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-03.html": {
   "file": "Q10288_SecretMission/32757-03.html",
   "quest": 10288,
   "text": "Greymore: Ah, now that, that is different. You must travel as silently as a feline, for you startled me and I am usually quite perceptive. Well, I must read this letter and it is not for the eyes of the uninitiated. So unless you have something else to tell me, you can be on your way now, wanderer.…",
   "header": "Greymore",
   "sets": {
    "reward": true
   },
   "outcome": "reward",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-02.htm": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-02.htm",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Hm... now that I think about it, might I tempt you with a mission from Dominic? It is not that I am incapable of doing it, but my face is too well known. Not like yours, at least not around here. Besides, you're already here, and if Dominic saw fit to trust you with this parcel, I …",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Accept the mission.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q10289_FadeToBlack 32757-03.htm",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q10289_FadeToBlack",
     "event": "32757-03.htm",
     "quest": 10289,
     "to": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-03.htm",
     "effect": "start"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-03.htm": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-03.htm",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Alright. I've been here studying these confounding monks and their secrets, but so far I've been unable to find anything or any information of value. Bloody quiet lot, these. I suspect we must capture someone higher up the chain of command, as it were. Master of Splendor Annays is …",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "sets": {
    "start": true
   },
   "outcome": "start",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-06.html": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-06.html",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: You captured him already? Alright, show me the proof, I must see his Mark of Splendor. Hmm... it would seem that other than startling me, you are skilled at nothing because you are not even a good liar. Bring me proof!",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "outcome": "refusal",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-07.html": {
   "file": "Q10289_FadeToBlack/32757-07.html",
   "quest": 10289,
   "text": "Priest Greymore: Ah, you captured him? I need to see the proof! ... No, that's just the Mark of Darkness. All it proves is that you are unlucky. Like I told you, I must have the Mark of Splendor ! That is the proof I require.",
   "header": "Priest Greymore",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
